	<row id="msg_0667_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rWe got NEW OBJECTS!\nI found ’em at a yard sale!\rWith these, you’ll meet MAD different\nhomies. Do your best!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rWe got NEW OBJECTS!\nI found ’em at a yard sale!\rWith these, you’ll meet MAD different\nhomies. Do your best!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rWe got NEW objects!\nThere’s SO many now!\rI think that’s plenty. My garage is\nempty.\rTry puttin’ down a bunch of different\nobjects to see what homies show up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rWe got NEW objects!\nThere’s SO many now!\rI think that’s plenty. My garage is\nempty.\rTry puttin’ down a bunch of different\nobjects to see what homies show up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rI thought of a NEW way to play!\nIt’s called Object Arrangement!\r...Wait...\nDid I already tell you about this?\rWell, we got new objects for Object\nArrangement...\r...I already told you that too...\rWell, that’s aight!\nI’m a busy man! Ideas everywhere!\rCome to the Safari Zone, you’ll see\nwhat I’m talkin’ about! See you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rI thought of a NEW way to play!\nIt’s called Object Arrangement!\r...Wait...\nDid I already tell you about this?\rWell, we got new objects for Object\nArrangement...\r...I already told you that too...\rWell, that’s aight!\nI’m a busy man! Ideas everywhere!\rCome to the Safari Zone, you’ll see\nwhat I’m talkin’ about! See you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rThere’s been a change in the homies in\nthe {STRVAR_1 4, 10, 0}, it seem...\rAfter a while with the same objects\nin the same Area, the kinds of homies\fthat settle there change.\rWe found if you completely\nremove the Area and then put it back\fwith the same objects, the original\fhomies come back.\fNo need to trip!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
