	</row>
	<row id="msg_0667_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThis Warden Baoba.\rLook like there’s been a lil change\nin the homies at the Safari Zone!\rIt’s in the {STRVAR_1 4, 10, 0} and the\n{STRVAR_1 4, 11, 0}.\rIf you put down a few objects that fit\nthe Area, the kinds of homies that\fsettle there change.\rWe found if you completely\nremove the Area and then put it back\fwith the same objects, the original\fhomies come back.\fNo need to trip!</language>
	</row>
