		<language name="English">Wassup?\nOh ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rMy bad. The Safari Zone ain’t ready\nyet. The contractor ghosted me.\fJust be patient a lil longer.\rI’ll hit you later.</language>
